# Oxide Dark for btop (no upstream port). Palette: oxide/colors.txt, mapping: docs/oxide-theme.md.
# Chrome monochrome; accents only for load state (green -> yellow -> red) and data series.

theme[main_bg]="#161616"
theme[main_fg]="#cecece"
